{% set local_problem %}
<p>Standard downspout extensions that work in suburban settings often aren't adequate for rural Elkmont properties dealing with clay soil and serious drainage challenges. When surface solutions can't move water far enough from your foundation, underground drains provide the permanent fix.</p>
